Another problem: if a saved world loads, chunks are generated after loadEdits and findSpawn, so guard still applies. Good. Trees previously generated at spawn in saved chunks? Chunks aren't saved, only edits. Good.

Also note the world's treeAt guard affects chunk generation consistently every time. Good.

